# ...but the CGE benchmark ground truth (results.csv + the comparative-
# statics fixtures shock_resolve.py regenerates) are test assets, tracked:
!examples/optimization/CGE/GAMS/*.csv
!examples/optimization/CGE/GAMS/shocks/*.csv
# LHR standard-CGE calibration fixtures are tracked sentinel-test assets.
!examples/optimization/cge-lite/lhr/*.csv
